    pause: "To begin everything is to accept that nothing that came before was wasted. Every chapter led precisely here.",
    reflection: "The last guests will leave. The garlands will dry. But the light that fell that afternoon — the way it caught the gold in her dupatta as she turned — that does not go anywhere. We made sure of it.",
    videoUrl: null, hasFilm: false,
    heroImage: "/api/storage/objects/uploads/5df28f22-550e-4f11-bdb0-268e07a258a5",
